OL,3,GNEWSAPolice forces failing
OL,4,Ainvestigation basics, says inspectorate
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany police forces in England and Wales
OL,8,Fstill need to make improvements in the
OL,9,Fway they investigate crime and other
OL,10,F"basics" of policing, according to His
OL,11,FMajesty's Chief Inspector of
OL,12,FConstabulary (HMIC).
OL,14,FIn her annual report, Michelle Skeer
OL,15,Falso said too many victims were not
OL,16,Freceiving the quality of service they
OL,17,Fshould expect.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
