OL,3,GNEWSAPolice forces failing
OL,4,Ainvestigation basics, says inspectorate
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FForces continue to struggle when it
OL,8,Fcomes to gathering evidence,
OL,9,Fidentifying and progressing lines of
OL,10,Finquiry, and keeping victims updated on
OL,11,Ftheir cases, she added.
OL,13,FThere was progress in neighbourhood
OL,14,Fpolicing and in some of the work
OL,15,Fcarried out by regional organised crime
OL,16,Funits that focus on offenders across
OL,17,Fmultiple local police force boundaries,
OL,18,Fthe report said.
